    return false;
  }

  return true;
}
```

This revised version of the function prioritizes the alphanumeric check, potentially reducing unnecessary computations for non-alphanumeric inputs. However, the difference in efficiency might be negligible unless you're dealing with a very large volume of inputs or performance-critical code paths.

